===Format===
* '''Group Stage:'''
** Two round-robin format groups
*** Each group has 4 teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Top 1 teams from each group advance to the Upper Bracket Semifinals
** Top 2-3 teams from each group proceed to the Upper Bracket Quarterfinals

* '''Playoffs:'''
** Double-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** The Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}

